  "notes": {
    "_leaflet": "REWE, \"27. Woche 2026. Gültig ab 29.06.2026\" (cover). REWE prints no struck prices in this leaflet (Knaller/Aktion prices only), so o is null throughout. REWE Bonus badges (\"0,10 € Bonus\") credit the Bonus account and do not lower the shelf price: put in c, never in lp. Bonus badges are free-floating near product images; their assignment to products is by proximity (badge above/left of the product text block) and must be checked on the image. Every price with a printed base price was linked by recomputing it. Brands are inline in REWE names; b is the leading brand word(s). Pages 3 to 6 were avoided: they contain image placeholder areas whose offers are not in the text layer.",
    "1": "Bonus page (\"Wöchentlich neue Bonus-Aktionen!\"). Five Bonus badges, assigned: Ritter Sport 0,10, Pril 0,10, Iglo 0,20, Granini 0,10, Barilla 0,10 (Granini vs Barilla could be swapped). Promotion \"Jetzt 10% Bonus auf Butcher’s\" has no price: not listed.",
    "7": "Origins (Spanien:, Italien:, etc.) are printed before the names and left out of n. Kiwi priced je St.",
    "9": "\"An der Bedientheke!\" page; all prices je 100 g at the service counter. Entrecôte is the KNALLER AKTION hero (2.99).",
    "11": "\"An der Bedientheke!\" page. \"Timmendorfer\" printed above \"Rügenwalder Teewurst\" (read as brand + product). Meisterschinken has no brand line in the text layer.",
    "13": "A \"0,10 € Bonus\" badge at the left margin (y 269) is not clearly tied to any product; not assigned. Rating badge \"4,6 von 5\" (rewe.de/test) and a \"Vegan\" badge also float near products.",
    "17": "A \"0,10 € Bonus\" badge at the top-left (y 16) is not clearly tied to any product; not assigned. \"Neu bei uns\" badges are not conditions.",
    "19": "KNALLER AKTION hero: Kahlua oder Absolut Vodka 10.99 (no single brand). Text layer spells \"Blance\" (sic) for the Francois Dulac wine.",
